jbod-go (@VERSION@) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Go port of Gandi/jbod-rs.
  * jbod: list enclosures, disks and cooling elements; switch locate and
    fault LEDs.
  * prometheus-jbod-exporter: enclosure temperatures and fan speeds in
    Prometheus text format, with jbod_up, jbod_scrape_duration_seconds,
    jbod_scrape_errors_total and the process_* metrics.
  * Collection runs in parallel, concurrent scrapes share one pass, and the
    exporter listens on 127.0.0.1 by default; arguments come from
    /etc/default/prometheus-jbod-exporter.

 -- @MAINTAINER@  @DATE@
